## Methods

- **Deletion (silme):** the data can no longer be accessed or reused by any user.
- **Destruction (yok etme):** the data can never again be accessed, recovered or reused by anyone.
- **Anonymisation (anonim hale getirme):** the data can no longer be linked to a person, even when combined with other data. Pseudonymisation is not anonymisation.
- A soft delete (`deleted_at`) is none of the above. It only hides the data.
